{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37772","headline":"驾部郑郎中三十八丈尹贰东周荣加金紫谷以末派之外恩旧事深因贺送 · 郑谷","name":"驾部郑郎中三十八丈尹贰东周荣加金紫谷以末派之外恩旧事深因贺送","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香浮玉陛晓辞天，袍拂蒲茸称少年。\n郎署转曹虽久次，京河亚尹是优贤。\n纵游云水无公事，贵买琴书有俸钱。\n今日龙门看松雪，探春明日向平泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}